WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:12.930
Hi! Mei is kind. Mei helps Mei's friends. Saying Mei again and again sounds odd. Pronouns make it simple. Today we'll learn pronouns.

2
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.994
For one boy or man, use he: Tom is tall. He is tall.

3
00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:21.186
For one girl or woman, use she.

4
00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:26.826
For one thing or animal, use it: The cat is black. It is black.

5
00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:31.602
For two or more people or things, use they.

6
00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:35.154
For a boy's things, use his: his bag.

7
00:00:35.304 --> 00:00:38.706
For a girl's things, use her: her hat.

8
00:00:38.856 --> 00:00:43.698
For an animal's things use its, and for many people's things use their.

9
00:00:43.848 --> 00:00:47.874
Mine is my, and ours is our.

10
00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:52.434
Watch out! Ravi is a boy, so we can't use her!

11
00:00:52.584 --> 00:00:55.050
A boy's things take his.

12
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.394
So it's Ravi lost his pencil.

13
00:00:59.544 --> 00:01:09.810
Your turn! Mum is cooking. ___, is in the kitchen. Which one? Pause and think.

14
00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:15.186
Mum is a woman, so she. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:15.336 --> 00:01:25.890
Another one! The dog is hungry. ___, wants food. Which one? Pause and think.

16
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:30.954
One animal takes it. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:31.104 --> 00:01:42.090
Here's another! Tom and Sam are friends. ___, play together. Which one? Pause and think.

18
00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:46.962
Two people take they. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:56.586
Try one more! Dad washed, ___, car. Which one? Pause and think.

20
00:01:56.736 --> 00:02:01.794
Dad is a man, so his. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:01.944 --> 00:02:11.874
Try one more! The girls packed, ___, bags. Which one? Pause and think.

22
00:02:12.024 --> 00:02:17.034
Many girls, so their. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:17.184 --> 00:02:26.922
Try one more! Mei brushed, ___, hair. Which one? Pause and think.

24
00:02:27.072 --> 00:02:32.082
Mei is a girl, so her. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:32.232 --> 00:02:41.898
Last one! The bird hurt, ___, wing. Which one? Pause and think.

26
00:02:42.048 --> 00:02:47.274
One bird's thing takes its. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:47.424 --> 00:02:54.858
Remember: he and his for a boy, she and her for a girl, it and its for a thing or animal, they and their for many.

28
00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:59.489
Talk about your family using he and she!

